# Inference is configured centrally — set NEBIUS_API_KEY in the repo-root compute.env (see COMPUTE.md).

# Optional: override the model. These scripts read MODEL_NAME (project-local); the shared
# compute.env config reads LLM_MODEL (global). Precedence, highest first:
#   --model <id>  >  MODEL_NAME (here)  >  LLM_MODEL (repo-root compute.env)  >  thesis default.
# So set MODEL_NAME here to change the model for this project only, or set LLM_MODEL in the
# repo-root compute.env to pin one model across every experiment.
# Left unset, the thesis default (mistralai/Mistral-Large-Instruct-2411) is used. Any open model
# id the shared config can resolve works, e.g.
#   meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct · Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct · deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3
# MODEL_NAME=mistralai/Mistral-Large-Instruct-2411

# A 300-round duopoly run = ~600 model calls. Scripts print the count and ask before spending.
